WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:06.279
"Oh no," Lucy said.

2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.763
"We're trapped in this clam!

3
00:00:08.764 --> 00:00:12.353
We can't change the battery.

4
00:00:12.354 --> 00:00:18.377
The planet will spin away into space!"

5
00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:22.261
"Calm down, Lucy," Ringo said.

6
00:00:22.262 --> 00:00:25.889
"Let's try to open the shell."

7
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.647
"You're not strong enough, Tiny," Lucy said.

8
00:00:29.648 --> 00:00:34.807
" I'll do

9
00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:39.297
it." Lucy stuck her diving knife in the

10
00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:41.739
gap. Nothing

11
00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:45.420
happened. "You can't do it either," PJ

12
00:00:45.421 --> 00:00:53.439
said. "This is a job for robots," Bot

13
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.430
said. The robots tried their

14
00:00:57.431 --> 00:01:02.145
lasers. But they didn't

15
00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:05.489
work. Then they pushed the shell

16
00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:10.078
apart. But they made only a small opening.

17
00:01:10.079 --> 00:01:15.547
"Let's go," Lucy said.

18
00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:18.858
Ringo slipped through with the battery.

19
00:01:18.859 --> 00:01:22.762
But Lucy was too big.

20
00:01:22.763 --> 00:01:26.466
The shell snapped shut again.

21
00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:29.526
"Uh-oh," Ringo said.

22
00:01:29.527 --> 00:01:32.701
Lucy and the robots were still trapped!

23
00:01:32.702 --> 00:01:34.994
He banged on the shell.

24
00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:38.708
"Go change the battery!" Lucy said.

25
00:01:38.709 --> 00:01:42.074
"Then come back for us."

26
00:01:42.075 --> 00:01:49.584
Ringo swam away from the clam.

27
00:01:49.585 --> 00:01:53.929
Soon he saw the gravity machine.

28
00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:57.581
"This will be easy," Ringo thought.

29
00:01:57.582 --> 00:02:00.940
He swam toward the machine.

30
00:02:00.941 --> 00:02:03.664
But then he saw something moving.

31
00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:07.915
The shark was back!

